  "goodToKnow": "Die Etikette is etiquette, rules of polite or formal behaviour: die Etikette am Hof, gegen die Etikette verstoßen. Careful: das Etikett is a label or tag on a bottle or garment. Good manners in general are Umgangsformen or Manieren. Germans call an etiquette guide der Knigge, after Adolph Freiherr Knigge, whose 1788 book was actually about dealing with people. It has no plural in this sense."
